<body>
<div data-lys aria-label="Riverbank greenhouse lighting pilot">
<article data-notes="Decision supported: authorize another measurement cycle. This pilot covered 18 non-randomly assigned plots at three sites over one winter cycle. Median yield difference was +6% versus site reference plots; plot differences ranged from −3% to +14%, and 12 of 18 plots were positive. Site crop mix and baseline conditions differed, so this observed difference is not evidence that lighting caused the result. Installation cost and energy use were not measured; wider installation is not supported by yield evidence alone.">
<p class="eyebrow">Riverbank greenhouse lighting · steering group</p>
<h1>What should the pilot evidence support next?</h1>
<div class="deck">
<section class="recommend" aria-labelledby="next-step">
<p class="label">Recommended decision</p>
<h2 id="next-step">Authorize another measurement cycle.</h2>
<p>Use the next cycle to measure yield alongside installation cost and energy use before considering wider installation.</p>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-label="Pilot yield evidence">
<div><h3>Observed yield difference</h3><div class="metric"><strong>+6%</strong><span>median vs each site’s reference plots</span></div></div>
<hr>
<p><strong>18 plots</strong> · 3 sites · 1 winter growing cycle</p>
<p>Plot differences: <span class="range">−3% to +14%</span><br><strong>12 of 18</strong> plots had a positive difference; 6 did not.</p>
</section>
</div>
<div class="caveat">
<p><strong>Interpret cautiously:</strong> plots were not randomly assigned; crop mix and baseline conditions differed between sites. The pilot does not establish that lighting caused the observed differences.</p>
<p><strong>Decision limit:</strong> installation cost and energy use were not measured. The steering group can authorize another measurement cycle; wider installation has not been approved.</p>
</div>
<footer>Observed pilot result · association only · not a causal estimate</footer>
</article>
</div>
